# Build artifacts.
#
# Patterns here must be anchored. A bare `fizzbuzz` line once matched the
# package directory com/example/enterprise/fizzbuzz/ and silently swallowed
# every source file under it -- gitignore excludes directories as readily as
# files, and a deeper negation cannot bring back what an excluded directory
# took with it.
*.o
*.hi
*.cmi
*.cmo
*.vo
*.vok
*.vos
*.glob
*.beam
*.class
*.exe
*.jar
.lia.cache
.nia.cache

# Compiled executables produced beside a source file by the few runners that
# cannot build into a temporary directory. Anchored to one level so it never
# matches a directory deeper in a source tree.
/languages/*/fizzbuzz
